{"schema_version":"1.0.0","metadata":{"trial_id":"202610081431-nether-temple-sonnet-effort-high","prompting_method_id":"concept-build-free.v0","model_id":"claude-sonnet-5-5","seed":11,"server_state_id":"concept-free.v1"},"style":{"name":"nether-ziggurat-shrine","rationale":"Second pass on the blackstone ziggurat shrine. Black mass, red infill, gold edge, teal at the top only. Changes against the first pass: (1) the heavy yellow roof ring is gone, because the concept roof is dark. The gold course is reduced to corner accents on a red-brick tread band, so the gold now sits on lintels and pilasters where the eye should land. (2) The front reads as three bays, with basalt columns at x5, 8, 12 and 15. The centre bay is a dark recessed portal flanked by gold pilasters, with a gold lintel and crown. Each side bay is a recessed red-brick panel with a lantern-lit arched window, and a gold lintel sits over each bay. (3) The side faces are finished with a basalt colonnade proud of the wall, recessed red panels, windows and gold lintels, so the building no longer shows blank sides. (4) The hall carries a chiseled frieze and a red-brick vent band under a top-half-stair eave. (5) The roof is a stepped stair-course pyramid from a 13-wide eave down to a 5x5 cap, with a red tread band on the lowest step. (6) The warped, shroomlight and gold drum, brick shaft, gold block and fence finial keep the narrow gold-capped skyline. (7) The plinth gets a half-slab step ring. Soul-fire braziers stand at the corners and flank the 5-wide bridge-stair that crosses the 2-wide lava moat to the sealed sanctum. Soul lanterns hang on chains at the eave corners and inside the portal."},"palette":{"manifest":["minecraft:polished_blackstone_bricks","minecraft:polished_blackstone_brick_stairs","minecraft:polished_blackstone_brick_slab","minecraft:chiseled_polished_blackstone","minecraft:gilded_blackstone","minecraft:polished_blackstone","minecraft:blackstone","minecraft:polished_basalt","minecraft:red_net